+# Password Hashing
+
+No password hashing algorithm decision is currently recorded in this project. A search of the repository's documentation, changelog, and history turned up no policy or decision specifying which algorithm to use for password hashing; the codebase's only password-related code (JSON/XML/form login binding examples and the Basic Auth middleware) does not perform or specify password hashing.
